# GitHub public forks cannot add new objects to the upstream repository's LFS
# store. Keep this self-contained asset as regular Git data; the largest file
# is 80.6 MB, below GitHub's 100 MiB per-file limit. The repository-wide LFS
# rules continue to apply to all other assets.
*.usd -filter -diff -merge -text
*.usda -filter -diff -merge -text
configuration/*.usd -filter -diff -merge -text
